                                            style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.875rem; margin-left: 0px; color: #6c757d; font-size: 14px; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial">We
                                            are writing to inform you about an important update regarding iMS Systems
                                            change log and version release.</span></div>
                                        <div style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start"><br></div>
                                        <div style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start"><span
